            <div xml:id="m-f093a246-dad7-4d3b-9ef5-34b2cb5e4179">
              <lg xml:id="m-4a2986ec-14af-4aae-87a8-b7d667644845">
                <l xml:id="m-83cfbeda-6cb0-4e44-8bf3-1e2288e42254" facs="#m-887fbd93-b1fa-4b24-9c0f-2db1638cf352" label="text-like">The Procession.</l><l xml:id="m-70d62374-41d9-4880-a636-55d8a5d150e5" facs="#m-89ce9381-cfd5-4b10-984f-667722f9d6c5" label="ambiguous">051</l><l xml:id="m-b7a4267e-ae25-4f64-944f-a044f799e68b" facs="#m-086a1a68-8888-428f-b696-f197f6029829" label="lyrics-like">Frúctus véntris gene-ró-si</l><l xml:id="m-0ab2464d-34b1-4103-9c60-ac76f96dae6b" facs="#m-dd095c56-1400-4507-96b7-b310ff893552" label="lyrics-like">Rex effúdit génti-um. 2. Nóbis</l><l xml:id="m-21e06a70-e4c2-4cf1-bbf4-ca4026b260eb" facs="#m-735c50b4-582c-44c2-aa02-27272d4a38fc" label="lyrics-like">dá-tus, nóbis ná-tus Ex intácta Vírgine,</l><l xml:id="m-6bbfe3a1-aa31-4962-9d75-6a8a48a54a82" facs="#m-5dae3fe4-8a7b-4af6-ba8a-e6633816cce5" label="lyrics-like">Et in mún¬</l><l xml:id="m-1e9884b8-bf54-4117-a627-645b5f272624" facs="#m-0786ac33-5ac7-4c0b-9552-2bed4c4f9ee3" label="lyrics-like">do conversá-tus, Spárso vérbi sémine,</l><l xml:id="m-e1e28bd4-c2a4-4c71-9635-80bfeba1e82b" facs="#m-b3f3e7cb-0486-490e-8ae0-aa8b162d49d9" label="lyrics-like">Sú-i mó-ras in¬</l><l xml:id="m-94600f9b-f7ab-488f-932b-542868f7b39d" facs="#m-682e8dee-77b4-4901-afa9-d5a6754b6877" label="lyrics-like">co-lá-tus Mí-ro cláusit órdine. 3. In suprémae nócte coé¬</l><l xml:id="m-262a9893-351c-49f6-8c94-5bd584e5a7a8" facs="#m-a381a31e-2eaa-4714-8817-0643f142c2e2" label="lyrics-like">Observá-ta lége ple¬</l><l xml:id="m-c40a08b1-e36e-429c-a674-dab62a7d8eea" facs="#m-ad9e2fec-f021-4e8f-a397-ba3602e738da" label="lyrics-like">nae Re-cúmbens cum frá-tribus,</l><l xml:id="m-10f10c2b-aae1-4efa-affc-ee9a029a9c36" facs="#m-67e5f12e-2f80-4d3f-815d-a6650d06f22c" label="lyrics-like">Cíbum túrbae du-odénae Se</l><l xml:id="m-148656b5-3410-4702-9147-7aad9d4d8c0e" facs="#m-c7efdbaf-ff7f-4047-a572-51105c9039e9" label="lyrics-like">ne Ckbis in legá-libus,</l><l xml:id="m-5b7345cd-a3f4-4d9a-852d-70808e5a31da" facs="#m-f5d2fcde-8aa6-4e4f-9ff1-d4002b4d6539" label="lyrics-like">dat sú-is mánibus. 4. Vérbum cáro, pánem vérum Vérbo</l><l xml:id="m-0e8924e2-c9c5-4627-88a5-5a75049d06fb" facs="#m-3a1be40e-1e92-45bd-a8c9-bd6128b1841a" label="lyrics-like">Fîtque Sánguis Chrísti mé-rum, Et</l><l xml:id="m-7c26a992-d58b-486e-96ae-60454a535c1f" facs="#m-998078e1-a4c4-4471-a8a6-97f66ef00e09" label="lyrics-like">cárnem éf-fi-cit:</l><l xml:id="m-d6c9b9f4-2248-40c0-931a-ad970bb8800a" facs="#m-6733faa8-3a80-49ab-89da-52b90b0c7231" label="lyrics-like">Ad firmándum cor sincé-rum Só-la</l><l xml:id="m-f36f016d-5418-4a03-a0b1-ac7c0ed10785" facs="#m-64c0f0b4-d423-4d3c-bc14-c283aad258e3" label="lyrics-like">si sénsus dé-fi-cit.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
